Third blind photo batch (16,324 photos, 19 sets): where the per-set recall gap to Community Forensics comes from.
Computed after the batch was scored, from the stored scores (macOS GPU); a description, not a tuned setting.
Community Forensics at its shipped threshold; Veracity scored on all six views (no early exit) so that the
threshold can be moved.

